# Context

## Why This Way
SE-P0-03 closed AC-125's last deferral: isolation, seed replay, and
backend-failure rollback now run as durable tests through the public
command, and each was re-verified through the oal executable on
2026-10-10 before AC-125 moved to covered/live.

## Gotchas
- The rollback fixture must rewrite ../../../packages/ imports to
  absolute file URLs; the repository root is two dirname calls above
  the pack directory, not one.
- The fixture's throw is counted on globalThis so the injected lines
  stay erasable-syntax TypeScript under Node type stripping.
